\f4 \cf3 lldb
\f0 \cf2  to disconnect the host from the target machine. \
When you no longer need to debug the target device, return the device to normal operation:\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\i\b \cf2 Step 1: Remove the boot-args\
\pard\tx360\tx576\pardeftab720\li576\fi-576\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0
\f0\i0\b0 \cf2 Run the 
\f4 \cf3 nvram
\f0 \cf2  tool in Terminal to remove the 
\f4 \cf4 boot-args
\f0 \cf2  key.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f4 \cf3   sudo nvram -d boot-args\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f0 \cf2 \
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\i\b \cf2 Step 2: Restore the Security Configuration of Your Mac\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\b0 \cf2 Modify the security configuration of your Mac by disabling SIP and enabling permissive security:\
\pard\tx360\tx576\pardeftab720\li576\fi-576\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reboot your Mac in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT201314"}}{\fldrslt Recovery Mode}}. \
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2.	}Connect your Mac to the internet, via a cable or Wi-Fi (internet access may be required to restore full security).\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3.	}Launch Terminal from the Utilities menu and run the following command to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/security/disabling_and_enabling_system_integrity_protection"}}{\fldrslt enable System Integrity Protection (SIP)}}:\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl1\cf3 {\listtext	\uc0\u8259 	}
\f4 csrutil enable
\f0 \
\pard\tx360\tx576\pardeftab720\li576\fi-576\sa120\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf2 {\listtext	4.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
If prompted to raise the security to \'93full\'94, enter 
\f4 \cf4 y
\f0 \cf2  to accept.\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
{\listtext	5.	}If your device is an Intel-based Mac that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT208862"}}{\fldrslt has the Apple T2 Security Chip}}, set {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT208330"}}{\fldrslt the Secure Boot policy}}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
 to \'93Full Security\'94.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6.	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reboot your Mac.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa120\partightenfactor0

