\f0\i0\b0 \cf2 Run the 
\f4 \cf3 nvram
\f0 \cf2  tool in Terminal to add the following argument to your device\'92s 
\f4 \cf4 boot-args
\f0 \cf2  key:\
\pard\tx540\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa120\partightenfactor0
